  "loc": "Abstract, p. 835; Sect. 5, p. 850",
  "quote": "We study criteria that compare mechanisms according to a property",
  "note": "The main object is a set of axiomatically characterised criteria (partial orders) for comparing general mechanisms (game forms) under multiple equilibria. The only application is to school choice matching mechanisms (DA2 vs BOS2), not to a voting procedure. Voting is mentioned only in related literature. Coding stopped."
